<Layout title="Absent Services — Nexus Wave Technologies" description="Explore Nexus products, plans, payment information and support.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">Absent Services</p><h1>Nexus Wave Technologies</h1><p class="lead">A simple place to explore Nexus Plus, Geeta Nexus, digital tools and available premium services.</p></div><div class="hero-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Before purchase</p><h2>Product and payment details are shown clearly.</h2><p class="muted">You can review what you are getting, the price, billing period when applicable, and refund information before you pay.</p></div></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container grid-2"><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">About the service</p><h2>Who provides these services?</h2><dl class="details"><dt>Brand</dt><dd>Nexus Wave Technologies</dd><dt>Founder</dt><dd>Kuldeep Kumar Yadav</dd><dt>Country</dt><dd>India</dd><dt>Website</dt><dd>nexusweb.co.in</dd><dt>Support email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a></dd></dl></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">What is offered</p><h2>Products and services</h2><ul class="feature-list"><li><strong>Nexus Plus:</strong> AI, audio, media, documents and accessibility-focused utilities.</li><li><strong>Geeta Nexus:</strong> spiritual learning centred on the Bhagavad Gita.</li><li><strong>Digital tools:</strong> designated utilities made available on the website.</li><li><strong>Premium access:</strong> selected advanced capabilities may be sold as subscriptions or usage-based AI credits.</li></ul></article></div></section>

  <section class="section surface-soft"><div class="container grid-3"><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Free</p><h3>Basic access</h3><p class="muted">Public information, designated free tools and spiritual reading can be used without purchasing premium access.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Subscription</p><h3>Premium plans</h3><p class="muted">Where offered, a subscription unlocks the specific premium capabilities listed with the plan. The exact plan duration and price are shown before confirmation.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Usage based</p><h3>AI credits</h3><p class="muted">Some metered AI features may use credits. The credit quantity, supported feature and purchase price are shown before payment.</p></article></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container card"><p class="eyebrow">Payment flow</p><h2>How payment works</h2><p class="muted">When a paid feature is available, the customer first reviews the selected product or plan, amount, currency, billing period where applicable, and relevant terms. Payment is then completed through the payment method provided for that purchase. Nexus Wave Technologies does not ask customers to email passwords, OTPs or complete card credentials.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/apps">Review products</a><a class="button" href="/legal/refund">Refund Policy</a><a class="button" href="/legal/terms">Terms & Conditions</a><a class="button" href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="section surface-soft"><div class="container grid-2"><article class="card"><h2>Refunds and failed payments</h2><p class="muted">Refund requests are handled according to the published Refund Policy, the transaction status, the service provided and applicable law. Failed or duplicate charges should be reported promptly with the transaction details.</p><a href="/legal/refund">Read Refund Policy</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Customer support</h2><p class="muted">For product or payment questions, contact <a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a>. Please do not send passwords, OTPs or full payment-card details by email.</p><a href="/contact">Contact support</a></article></div></section>
</Layout>